  "title": "Palak Paneer (Curried Spinach)",
  "description": "Fresh spinach (palak) and paneer are simmered with Indian curry spices like ginger, cloves, and cumin in this easy vegetarian main dish.",
  "authors": [
    "maliland"
  ],
